@2007 = ~Vampiric Club~
@2008 = ~This item was created by Urkodoël to support customers who might easily succumb to the temptation of the power he has to offer.

PROPERTIES:

COMBAT ABILITIES:
- Each hit drains 1 hit point from the target and transfers it to the wielder
- On a critical hit, permanently drains 1 maximum hit point from the target and adds it to the wielder's maximum hit points

THAC0: +3
Damage: 1d6+3 (crushing)
Speed Factor: 1
Proficiency Type: Club
Type: One-handed weapon
Requires: 5 Strength

Weight: 1~

